title: "Google DocID Research: Calculating Google's Internal Document Identifiers from URLs"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "de Segonzac"
    given-names: "Olivier"
    affiliation: "Resoneo"
repository-code: "https://github.com/OliSeg/google-docid-research"
url: "https://think.resoneo.com"
abstract: >-
  Google Search docids are Google's legacy Fingerprint() of the exact URL string
  (two Jenkins lookup2 hashes with seeds 0 and 102072). Empirical validation on
  Google Search, Images, Discover and News data, and a tested Python implementation.
keywords:
  - google-search
  - docid
  - fingerprint
  - reverse-engineering
  - technical-seo
